# Allowlist strategy: ignore everything, then whitelist what we want to version.
# This prevents accidentally leaking transcripts, tokens, or caches.

*

# --- Allowed: structural ---
!.gitignore

# --- Allowed: instructions ---
!CLAUDE.md

# --- Allowed: user-owned config ---
!settings.json
!keybindings.json
!statusline-command.sh

# --- Allowed: customization directories (recursive) ---
!commands/
!commands/**
!agents/
!agents/**
!skills/
!skills/**
# NOTE: skills/synced/ is NOT versioned. It is the local cache of the skills that
# come from the Claude account itself: every machine signed into the account
# re-downloads it automatically, the bucket directory is named after the org/user
# ids, and the bundled Office skills are proprietary Anthropic material whose
# license forbids retaining or distributing copies outside the service.
skills/synced/
!hooks/
!hooks/**
!output-styles/
!output-styles/**
!plugins/
!plugins/config.json
!plugins/installed_plugins.json
# NOTE: plugins/known_marketplaces.json is intentionally NOT versioned.
# It is auto-generated by Claude Code and contains machine-specific absolute
# paths (installLocation: /Users/... vs /home/...), so it would conflict on
# every machine. Each host keeps its own local copy.

# --- Hard-ignore sensitive / local-only even if re-included above ---
settings.local.json
.claude.json
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/*.backup.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/credentials*
**/*token*
**/*secret*
